Package: GECO
Type: Package
Title: Gene Covariance Estimation Across Cell Types from Single-Cell Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Xinpei", "Wang", email = "xinpei1016@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: An end-to-end pipeline that estimates gene-by-gene
    covariance, standard errors, p-values, sparse precision matrices,
    and node degrees from a QC'd .h5ad single-cell expression file.
    The pipeline accepts a .h5ad file and configurable metadata column
    names, decomposes the variance into an across-individual component
    (shared) and a within-cell-type component, optionally regressing
    out fixed covariates, and produces per-cell-type covariance, SE,
    p-value, and precision matrices plus a degree summary spreadsheet.
